Working through these directly against the rule — most units resolve to a single correct sentence-boundary split, but three (units 2, 4, 8) have no candidate that fully resolves the fusion without either leaving a mid-clause severance, a fused remainder, or an invalid mid-list/mid-word break, so I've flagged those as missing.

